    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a thought-provoking session at the Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED), students and guests were immersed in the world of science through a special lecture by distinguished nuclear physicist, Dr Pervez Hoodbhoy. The event, held on January 25, 2024, provided a unique opportunity to explore the essence of science and effective teaching methods.",
